```

That is going to lend itself to these types of problems when dealing with extremely long binary expressions. Or other deeply nested calls like deeply chained fluent API calls. Instead I would consider using the following pattern: 

```csharp
foreach (var token in node.DescendantTokens())
{
    // do work
}
```
